cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these data or this pipeline, please cite them as below. Each
  daily release is a git tag (data/<date>-r<n>); please also name the tag you
  used, so others can rebuild exactly the data you had.
type: dataset
title: >-
  ebola-bdbv-data: health-zone-level case and death series for the 2026
  Bundibugyo virus disease outbreak in the DRC, extracted from INSP situation
  reports
authors:
  - family-names: Buffalo
    given-names: Vince
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/vsbuffalo/ebola-bdbv-data
url: https://vsbuffalo.github.io/ebola-bdbv-data/
abstract: >-
  Analysis-ready case, death, laboratory and clinical-care series for the 2026
  Bundibugyo virus disease (Ebola) outbreak in the Democratic Republic of the
  Congo, extracted from the daily situation reports of the Institut National de
  Santé Publique (INSP) down to the health zone. Every number is checked
  against the arithmetic of the page that printed it, every source PDF is
  pinned by its SHA-256 hash, and each daily release is a git tag that
  rebuilds exactly.
keywords:
  - Ebola
  - Bundibugyo virus
  - Democratic Republic of the Congo
  - outbreak surveillance
  - situation reports
  - epidemiological data
